{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0334_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "7541eaa1eedeaff8ac2d79642b58b90d4233d134cffa866afc8ade649b05014a", "ja": "えっと、着方はこれで合ってる……よね。\nうーん、大丈夫かな……？", "zh": "那个，穿法这样应该没错……吧。\n嗯……真的没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
