{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0334_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "7ae228264ff89ffb250d8713f8f99c4f611f394ea9422212940704b8aeeaaef9", "ja": "なるほど……。つまり、\n『カッコカワイイ』ってことですね！？", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，\n是“帅气又可爱”吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
